                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519225421980-715cb0215aed?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Wedding Photo 3" class="w-full h-80 object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700">
